        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Operator workflow and SOC handoff",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 61,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Establish pipeline trust before drawing security conclusions\n1. Confirm **healthy lanes** and inspect the **stalest source**.  2. Check queue use, delivery success, response classes, and p95/p99 latency.  3. Treat source gaps as explicit missing-context evidence.  4. Verify durable storage and checkpoint freshness.  5. Confirm the **Relay receive → privacy → correlation → delivery** flow before expecting agent traces.  6. Open **Kibana → OpenShell SOC - Analyst Triage and Investigation** for alerts, sandbox timelines, privacy-filtered agent traces, and policy-enforcement evidence.\n\nMetrics intentionally exclude sandbox, event, trace, session, request, URL, and customer identifiers to keep cardinality bounded."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Durable storage capacity",
      "description": "Free bytes and inodes visible to the exporter for each fixed checkpoint, queue, and recovery role. Paths are never labels. Size alerts from measured outage headroom rather than the demo threshold.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "openshell-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (storage) ({__name__=~\"openshell_exporter_storage_free_bytes|openshell\\\\.exporter\\\\.storage\\\\.free_bytes\",storage=~\"$storage\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Free bytes · {{storage}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "min by (storage) ({__name__=~\"openshell_exporter_storage_free_inodes|openshell\\\\.exporter\\\\.storage\\\\.free_inodes\",storage=~\"$storage\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Free inodes · {{storage}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "noValue": "Storage metrics unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "B"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "min"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "asc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Durable storage health",
      "description": "One means the filesystem containing the configured durable role is available to the exporter; zero requires immediate investigation. No data means the storage-health extension is not being scraped.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "openshell-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min by (storage) ({__name__=~\"openshell_exporter_storage_available|openshell\\\\.exporter\\\\.storage\\\\.available\",storage=~\"$storage\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{storage}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Unavailable",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "Available",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "noValue": "Storage metrics unavailable"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Durable state freshness",
      "description": "Age of the newest direct state entry, state presence, and bounded-scan truncation by durable role. Missing state can be normal before first use; truncation means age coverage is incomplete, not that capacity data is missing.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "openshell-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 44,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (storage) ({__name__=~\"openshell_exporter_storage_state_age_seconds|openshell\\\\.exporter\\\\.storage\\\\.state_age_seconds\",storage=~\"$storage\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Age · {{storage}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (storage) ({__name__=~\"openshell_exporter_storage_state_present|openshell\\\\.exporter\\\\.storage\\\\.state_present\",storage=~\"$storage\"})",
          "legendFormat": "State present · {{storage}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "max by (storage) ({__name__=~\"openshell_exporter_storage_scan_truncated|openshell\\\\.exporter\\\\.storage\\\\.scan_truncated\",storage=~\"$storage\"})",
          "legendFormat": "Scan truncated · {{storage}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
